# This folder is symlinked as Sublime's Packages/User, so Sublime and its
# plugins write machine-local state here at runtime. Keep that noise out of
# the repo; real settings files show up in git status and get committed.
Package Control.cache/
Package Control.ca-*
Package Control.last-run
Package Control.merged-ca-bundle
Package Control.system-ca-bundle
Package Control.user-ca-bundle
oscrypt-ca-bundle.crt
Anaconda.last-check
*.sublime-workspace
# Plugin-generated dirs/files (Terminus color schemes, Log Highlight syntaxes)
Log Highlight/
Terminus/
Terminus.hidden-color-scheme
